{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39920","headline":"尚书惠蜡面茶 · 徐夤","name":"尚书惠蜡面茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武夷春暖月初圆，采摘新芽献地仙。\n飞鹊印成香蜡片，啼猿溪走木兰船。\n金槽和碾沈香末，冰椀轻涵翠缕烟。\n分赠恩深知最异，晚铛宜煮北山泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}